  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Uganda: Use of Revenue Consultants</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Design and strengthen the revenue management component of the OfD programme in specific OfD candiate and partner countries. Assignments will be awarded following mini-competition between the three consultant consortia that have entered into framework agreements with Norad. They are Vista Analyse, Menon Economics and Vidar Ovesen.</narrative>
  </description>
